# Product Standards (agent contract)

Canonical detail: `docs/PRODUCT_STANDARDS.md`. Engineering process:
`docs/ENGINEERING-PLAYBOOK.md`.

## Mission

**Observe. Understand. Create. Share.** Deepen curiosity—do not replace it.

## Feel

Calm, trustworthy, honest, welcoming, curious, encouraging, thoughtful.
No urgency hacks, artificial scarcity, or engagement farming.

## Non-negotiables

- Trust is the product — facts vs estimates vs placeholders must be clear.
- Never fabricate data; honest loading and honest errors.
- Privacy first; local-first when practical; transparent permissions.
- Honest AI — coach/explain, never fake certainty.
- Accessibility and responsive layouts by default; progressive enhancement.
- Education via observation/coaching — not homework, grades, or quizzes.
- Outdoor ethics and scientific integrity.

## Decision tie-break

Prefer trust, clarity, learning, curiosity, kindness, privacy, accessibility,
scientific honesty, long-term maintainability.

## Product quality bar

Every change should improve at least one of: trust, clarity, reliability,
accessibility, performance, maintainability, scientific integrity. Features
must simplify or clearly add value—not noise.
